### boundary_guard help probe
usage: boundary_guard [-h] [--crate-root CRATE_ROOT]
                      [--baseline-dir BASELINE_DIR]
                      {init,check,pin} ...

Freeze and enforce the trusted boundaries of a Verus proof mission (TCB leaf-
set + top-level spec).

positional arguments:
  {init,check,pin}
    init                freeze the current boundaries
    check               verify boundaries are intact
    pin                 sanction a SPECIFIC leaf by its exact content
                        (content-pinned; mainly for one operator-vetted
                        assume)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --crate-root CRATE_ROOT
                        crate root scanned for *.rs source (default: .)
  --baseline-dir BASELINE_DIR
                        dir holding frozen snapshots (default: .verus_agent)
### operator_decisions help probe
usage: operator_decisions [-h] [--project-root PROJECT_ROOT]
                          {record-attempt,add,list,show,audit,gate,needs-evidence,migrate-legacy,certify,supersede,resolve}
                          ...

operator_decisions — a structured, machine-readable queue of operator-owned
gates.

positional arguments:
  {record-attempt,add,list,show,audit,gate,needs-evidence,migrate-legacy,certify,supersede,resolve}
    record-attempt      append a failed/inconclusive proof attempt
    add                 append an operator-owned gate (engineer)
    list                show queue
    show                print one entry
    audit               validate candidate packet structure
    gate                classify invalid, candidate-review, and pending
                        frontiers
    needs-evidence      record Reviewer request for more evidence
    migrate-legacy      preserve a pre-schema active entry as needs_evidence
    certify             promote a reviewed candidate to pending_operator
    supersede           retire a candidate after its obligations are
                        discharged
    resolve             set an entry's status (operator)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --project-root PROJECT_ROOT
